description:
Investiflex https://investiflex.com/ is a fintech AI startup offering portfolio and risk management solutions for investors and financial managers.

We have strong early traction, and are looking for a Head of AI to boost up our product development.

You will be responsible for the architecture, technical design, and leading the development team.

This is a ground floor opportunity to become an integral part of a fast\-growing business, suitable for an entrepreneur\-minded AI engineer.

Compensation is based on equity initially.

Requirements:

Degree in Computer Sciences, Software Engineering, preferably AI related ;

Knowledge of ML models, LLMs, generative AI, agentic AI;  
Hands\-on full\-stack development experience in python, node.js, react.js;  
Good knowledge of Linux (Ubuntu);  
Understanding of algorithms and data structures;  
Working knowledge of MySQL;  
Experience in building AI models;  
Previous startup experience is a plus.

Job Types: Full\-time, Part\-time

Work Location: Remote
